          "source": "ARCH",
          "startLine": 4,
          "endLine": 4,
          "quote": "The controller has separate dutyCommand and standbyCommand output ports. Each pump skid has one conjugated command input port and forwards it by binding to its motor's command input port."
        },
        {
          "source": "WORKSHOP",
          "startLine": 4,
          "endLine": 4,
          "quote": "The naming, packaging and reusable SysML vocabulary in this exercise may be chosen by the model author without changing the source facts. Group all declarations under PumpStationStudy. Use Command ports carrying StartRequest and a CommandExchange interface with a directed flow from source to target. The stop, fault and reset events are motor behavior triggers; no station routing for these events is specified."
